			"notes": "* major changes: it's even easier to use the config2brigadier now!\n    * simply call the `generateReloadableConfigCommand(MOD_ID, commandDispatcher, , /*config reader*/);` on your `config` to generate whole command tree.\n    * includes the reload as well if you provide the config reader bit (see readme or testmod implementation)\n* squashed some bugs\n* **permission support**!\n    * each node will add to permission tree, e.g. \n```\n/mymod config edit optionFloat 5.0\n```\nWill require permission `mymod.config.edit.optionFloat`. Permission is granted to OPs by default\n* dropped other loaders suport, only fabric is supported rn. (You'll need to update your modImplementation line in build.gradle)"
		}
